{
  "id": "1CH.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Int 12",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iltung'ana ootang'asa aasuj Daudi lo losho le Benchamen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo tung'ana apa ooetuo enetii Daudi te Siklag, ina kata metumoki ashomo oleng tenkaraki Saul olayioni le Kish; netii apa ninche tenebo lelo tung'ana magil ootareto ninye to larrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iltung'ana oong'oroo mbaa ninche, naa keidim ninche aatang'oroi mbaa nenang'aa isoito te nkopito, te nkaina e tatene aashu te kedienye. Ile Benchamen ninche, lo lgilata le Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa olkitok lenye naa Ahiesa, nesujaki Yoash, naa ilayiok le Shemaa pokira, le Gibea; o Yesiel sii o Pelet ilayiok le Asmafet; o Beraka, o Yehu le Anatot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Ishmai le Gibeon, ilo tung'ani magilani te lelo tomoni uni naa olarikoni le lelo tomoni uni; o Yeremia o Yohasiel, o Yohanan, o Yosabad le Gedera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Elusai, o Yerimot, o Bealia, o Shemaria, o Shefatia, le Harufi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Elkana, o Ishia, o Asarel, o Yoeser, o Yashobeam, le Kora; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Yaela, o Sebadia, lelo ayiok le Yeroham le Gedor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilaisiayak le Daudi to losho le Gad",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Gad nepuo enetii Daudi to sempewuet otii ong'ata ilmurran magil oogol, arriyiak too long'oi o remeta, ootiu nkomomi enye anaa iloo ng'atunyo, neneneng anaa ntarakueti too nchumat oo ldoinyio: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esa laa ninye olkitok, o Obadia aa ninye oliare, o Eliab aa ninye oliokuni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Mishamana aa ninye oliong'uan, o Yeremia aa ninye olayioni le imiet, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Atai aa ninye olayioni le ile, o Eliel, aa ninye oliopishana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Yohanan aa ninye olayioni le isiet, o Elasabad aa ninye olioudo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Yeremia naa ninye olayioni le tomon, o Makabania aa ninye olayioni le tomon oobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo tung'ana apa le Gad ninche ilkituaak le njore. Ore ilkuti naa shumata e iip nabo, ore ilkumok naa shumata enkalifu nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo tung'ana apa lelo ootalang'a olkeju le Yordan to lapa le dukuya, ina kata edooyo enkare aim mpoorri, neisikie lelo pooki ootii ierat, te nkalo o loo saen o to loo ntoluo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kulikae tung'ana le Benchamen o Yuda nepuonu osempewuet enetii Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo Daudi anang'are ninche nejoki ninche, “Tenaa iyetuo intae enatii nanu to sotua, pee kiretutu nanu, naa keibung'are oltau lai intae; kake tenaa ietuo pee kikaldaa too lmang'ati laainei, hoo tenemaata entorroni nataasa nchoo naa edol Enkai oo loo papa neitalaku te intae.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu enkiyang'et o Laitoriani shumata Amasia, ilo kitok le tomoni uni, nejo ninye:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilasujak Le Daudi oing'uaa Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kulikae tung'ana le Manase neisik aapuo enetii Daudi ina kata pee epuonu Ilfilisti olarrabal aarare Saul. (Ore ake eyia eitu ninye eretu Lfilisti, amu eiguanate ilaitoriak lenye nearaa ninye, ejo, “Ilukuny ang edung'ori, teneing'uaa ninye iyiook nerrinyokino olkitok lenye Saul.”) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee epuo Siklag nepuo kulo tung'ana le Manase enetii ninye: Adna, o Yodabad, o Yediel, o Mikael, o Yosabad, o Elihu o Siletai, o laiguanak le nkalifu te Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etareto apa ninche Daudi tialo olturrur loo lapurrok, amu iltung'ana apa oopi ninche naa magil, naa ilarikok le njore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore apa too nkolong'i pooki naa kepuonu apa iltung'ana enetii Daudi, ometaba anaa neaku olorora kitok le njore, nebayu anaa enjore e Nkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkarn e lelo le njore e Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena ninye esiana e lelo timito le njore le Daudi, apa ooetuo enetii Daudi te Hebron, pee eibelekeny enkitoria e Saul aaibelekenyaki Daudi, te risioroto o rorei lo Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo tung'ana le Yuda oata ilong'oi o remeta naa nkalifuni ile o iip isiet ilturrurri ootanapate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Simeon, iltung'ana magil arriyiak to larrabal, naa nkalifuni naapishana o iip nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Lawi naa nkalifuni ong'uan o iip ile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ilo kitok oji Yehoida le nkaji e Aron, ore tenebo ninye netii iltung'ana nkalifuni uni o iip naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Sadok, ilo barnoti magilani nepi netii tenebo ilarikok le njore tikitam oare lolmarei lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Benchamen, ilo le ntalipa oo Saul, netii iltung'ana nkalifuni uni, ore ilkumok lenye neibung'are enkaji e Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Efraim naa iltung'ana nkalifuni tikitam o iip isiet, iltung'ana magil oopi, iltung'ana ooning'o too nkajijik oo loo menye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore olpisiai lo losho le Manase naa iltung'ana nkalifuni tomon oisiet, laa ninche apa etegeluaki pee epuonu aaitaa Daudi olaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Isaakar, lelo tung'ana ang'eni ooyiolo nkatitin, ooyiolo enayieu Israel neas, naa iltung'ana kituaak iip are, tenebo lelo alashera lenye pooki ootii abori enkitoria enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Sebulon naa iltung'ana nkalifuni onom, ootanapate to larrabal neeta masaa pooki e njore o larrabal, pee eretu Daudi to ltau obo metii olng'ash. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Naftali naa ilkituaak le njore enkalifu nabo ootii tenebo iltung'ana nkalifuni tomoni uni oopishana oata ilong'oi o remeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Dan naa iltung'ana nkalifuni tikitam oisiet o iip ile iltung'ana ootanapate pee epuo olarrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Asheri naa iltung'ana nkalifuni artam o iip ile arriyiak te pooki arrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too le Ruben o le Gad o lpisiai lo losho le Manase ootii lido kekun olkeju le Yordan naa iltung'ana nkalifuni iip nabo o tikitam oota imasaa pooki olarrabal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
