          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kulo tung'ana pooki lo larrabal, neishopo iruparen, nepuonu Hebron eeta eyieunoto pee eitaa Daudi olaiguanani le Israel pooki. Neijia sii apa etiu ilkulikae tung'ana le Israel, etumuta nabo pee eitaa Daudi olaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa ninche tenebo Daudi too nkolong'i uni, einos endaa neokisho, amu eitobirakitia apa ilalashera lenye ina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore sii lelo le latia enye ebaiki Isaakar o Sebulon o Naftali, nepuonu enapita ndaiki too sirkon, o too ntamesin o too nyumpui, o too lmong'i, neyau ndaiki kumok, o mukateni oo lng'abolo, o sabibu ooitoyioki, o enaisho oo sabibu o eilata, o lmong'i o lkerra, amu keetae apa enchipai te Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
